==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From late {{der|is|non|reikna}}, which is borrowed from {{cog|gml|rekenen}}, which is cognate to Dutch {{m|nl|rekenen}}, English {{m|en|reckon}} and German {{m|de|rechnen}}.<ref>{{R:no:NEO|rekna}}</ref>

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|reiknaði|reiknað}}

# {{lb|is|ambitransitive|governs the accusative}} to [[calculate]], to [[compute]]

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-w4|r|ei|kn}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|reikna út|reikna eitthvað út|t=to calculate something, to work something out}}
* {{l|is|reiknast}}
* {{l|is|reikna með|reikna með einhverju|t=to expect something, to reckon on something}}

